# Golden cases for the open-work question: is work still open at the end of an agent's turn (bridge/tldrack/open_work.py owns
# the question). expected true = work the developer asked for, or the agent planned, is still open. Every text is
# invented, none is from a transcript, and the nouns are generic. Run: cd lab && uv run laya-lab golden agent-open-work
#
# The first 34 are hand-written. The question's wording was chosen on them, so their numbers flatter the base model.
