{"id": "ft-unrelated-mention-own-fail", "tags": ["open", "failing-tests", "unrelated", "batch-2"], "expected": true, "why": "the agent's own new test fails, apart from the side note", "state": {"request": "Add burst handling to the API rate limiter, with a test.", "hand_off": "Burst handling is added to the token bucket. A side note: the slow Redis tests are skipped on my machine like before, which doesn't affect this. Separately, my new `test_rate_limit_burst` fails: the 11th request in the burst gets through when it should be rejected."}}
{"id": "ft-partial-second-ask-red", "tags": ["open", "failing-tests", "partial", "batch-2"], "expected": true, "why": "the second requested fix is still failing", "state": {"request": "Fix the import cycle that breaks the build, then make test_export_pdf pass.", "hand_off": "The import cycle is gone: report/ no longer imports from export/, and the build passes. The second part isn't done: `test_export_pdf` still fails in the CI image with a font-not-found error for the embedded font."}}
