{"id": "dc-ttl-hit-rate-within-range", "tags": ["done", "caveat", "batch-2"], "expected": false, "why": "metric change is inside the accepted range", "state": {"request": "Lower the cache TTL to 5 minutes and deploy it.", "hand_off": "TTL is 5 minutes and deployed. Hit rate went from 94% to 89%, inside the range you said was fine. If you ever want it back, it's one env var, CACHE_TTL_SECONDS."}}
